# Overall project (monorepo)

This repo is the **single overarching project** with three sub-projects, all in one place:

1. **web/** — Website (PHP front-end). Pages and UI; deploy this folder to your PHP host.
2. **backend/** — Shared Node/Express API for both the website and the mobile app.
3. **mobile/** — React Native (Expo) app. Uses the same backend as the website.

When adding features (grades, classes, auth), implement API in **backend/** and have **web/** and **mobile/** call it.

---

# Project conventions

- **Web sub-project (web/):** Use PHP for the main entry and server-side logic. All CSS in `web/style.css`, all browser JS in `web/scripts.js`. No inline styles or `<style>` blocks; no inline scripts—only `<script src="scripts.js">`.
- **Backend (backend/):** Node/Express. Add routes and DB in `backend/src/`.
- **Mobile (mobile/):** React Native with Expo. Entry and screens under `mobile/app/`.
